  "prefLabel": "Plc 1903.08 Processing of Applications for Initial Certification; Decisions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1903.08 Processing of Applications for Initial Certification; Decisions.\n\n(a) Within 30 days of receipt of an application for initial certification submitted pursuant to Plc 1903.03 for doulas or Plc 1903.07 for LSPs, the licensing bureau shall process the application as provided in Plc 304.06.\n\n(b) The application shall be subject to the abandonment provisions of Plc 304.06(h) and the withdrawal provisions of Plc 304.07.\n\n(c) After determining that an application is complete, the licensing bureau shall review the application and notify the applicant of its decision in accordance with Plc 304.08 and Plc 304.09.\n\nSource. #14429, eff 1-16-26, EXPIRES 1-16-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1900.html"
